  "item_short_desc": "<p>Designed with comfort and warmth in mind, our Womens Trailsman Sherpa Fleece Jacket is a must-have for all your outdoor activities. Whether you&rsquo;re embarking on a challenging hiking expedition, exploring new trails, or simply enjoying a casual stroll in nature, this full-zip fleece jacket ensures you are ready for any outdoor venture.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Designed with comfort and warmth in mind, our Womens Trailsman Sherpa Fleece Jacket is a must-have for all your outdoor activities. Whether you&rsquo;re embarking on a challenging hiking expedition, exploring new trails, or simply enjoying a casual stroll in nature, this full-zip fleece jacket ensures you are ready for any outdoor venture. Comfortable Design: Crafted from high pile 100% polyester sherpa fleece that&rsquo;s soft to the touch, this midweight jacket provides the perfect balance of warmth, breathability, and comfort. The comfortable fleece jacket can be worn as a standalone jacket (perfect for fall and spring), or as a liner underneath a winter coat. Cold Weather Protection: Equipped with a full zip main closure featuring an interior storm placket, this womens fleece jacket offers exceptional defense against the wind and cold. The elastic cuffs and drawstring bottom keeps the wind out, ensuring you stay snug and warm. This helps seal in the warmth, preventing unnecessary heat loss. Dependable and Long-Lasting: In addition to providing comfort and functionality, the Trailsman Sherpa Fleece Jacket is also rugged and is built for any outdoor adventurer. The reinforced shoulder yoke enhances the jacket&rsquo;s durability and performance. Convenient Pocket Storage: These soft outdoor jackets feature a left chest zipper pocket for storing essentials like keys or a wallet. The front zipper slash pockets provide ample space for keeping your hands warm or for holding small everyday carry items.</p>",
